The ".PS" file in this directory contain the CP/M 2.2 manual, in Postscript
format. It was scanned, then converted to a text file with OCR software.

NOTE : NO REPRESENTATION IS MADE AS TO THE ACCURACY OF THE TRANSLATION 
PROCESS. UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES WILL CALDERA BE HELD RESPONSIBLE FOR ANY
ERRORS IN THE SCANNING/OCR/PROOFREADING PROCESS. 

This manual is simply provided in the hope that some will find it useful.

The files in this directory are :

CPM22-M.PS      : The main manual file.
*.ASM           : Source files from the appendixes
*.LIB           : DISKDEF macro library
*.XRF           : Assembly cross reference listings
READ.ME         : this file


ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS

It is with much gratitude that we acknolodge the efforts od Roger Ivie, 
